{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/776029-benediction-sanctification-of-the-blessed-virgin","id":776029,"title":"Benediction: Sanctification of the Blessed Virgin","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-28T08:21:24-08:00","id":776029,"title":"Benediction: Sanctification of the Blessed Virgin","content":"Hello, this power as described in Hunter The Vigil Corebook, allows the hunter to turn a regular item in a Blessed one, for remaining of the scene. If another Point of Willpower is spent, this Blessing is permanent. Each Roll takes one Turn of praying. Ok, that's all...<br /> <br /> ...Don't you think that is very easy? So it means that a Mallus Maleficarium in one week that passed inside the story, can created dozens of blessed item, for him and for all other players in the group? With one skill and spent a little Willpower that can be recovered you create a arsenal against, virtually, any creature?<br /> <br /> How do you deal with it in your game?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9723-winchester","name":"winchester","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-28T08:34:57-08:00","id":776038,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't exactly call &quot;Ghosts, one sort of demon and maybe a strix or vampire if you get lucky&quot; &quot;virtually any creature&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-30T19:53:03-08:00","id":777510,"title":"","content":"Don't give my players time to breathe.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-30T20:14:31-08:00","id":777518,"title":"","content":"The PCs aren't the only ones with brains. If they try (and become known for) a tactic, any tactic, enemies can and will take that into account to screw them over if they become complacent about it (or obnoxious).<br /> <br /> In the above example, Elfive already listed how limited the effectiveness of Blessed items/weapons are, so even if the PCs fight predominately targets who would be affected (such as ghosts or Inferno demons), have those targets call in outside context hitters (mortal hitmen, any other supernatural, etc.) who are immune to the cheap trick.<br /> <br /> Hunters don't live long if they only have one hammer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}